sldprt2step — .SLDPRT → STEP converter
=================================================

This package is a Python port of "open-sld-to-step", a clean-room
Node.js/TypeScript library that parses Microsoft OLE Structured Storage in
.SLDPRT files, extracts the internal Parasolid geometry streams, and
translates them into ISO 10303 (STEP AP214) files.

