Clean-room / interoperability notice
------------------------------------
The upstream converter is a clean-room implementation developed for
interoperability, written from public specifications and standards:

  * The [MS-CFB] Compound File Binary File Format specification (Microsoft).
  * The ISO 10303 (STEP) family of standards for product-data exchange.
  * Public-domain technical references describing the Parasolid BRep model
    topology (body -> lump -> shell -> face -> loop -> edge -> vertex).
  * Observable byte-level structure of publicly available, non-restricted CAD
    sample files (the NIST MBE PMI Validation and Conformance Testing data
    sets, which are U.S. Government works in the public domain, 17 U.S.C. 105).

No proprietary source code, header files, SDKs, or API documentation from
Dassault Systemes, Siemens, or any other vendor has been used, referenced, or
reverse-engineered in the development of the upstream converter or this port.

